{"seq":3,"slug":"transit-time-sla-data","title":"在途时长与承运 SLA 数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/delivery-promise-engine/promise-data-calendar/transit-time-sla-data","wordCount":3005,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"在途时长与承运-sla-数据\">在途时长与承运 SLA 数据</h1><p>包裹出了仓，承诺的后半段开始计时。这一段跨越国境、跨越多个承运组织的交接，是我们<strong>控制力最弱、信息最稀疏</strong>的一段——我们看不到包裹，只能看到零星扫描事件，而最终签收时间要等到用户真的收到了才会回传。因此在途时长的建模，本质上是一个「用稀疏、滞后、有偏的历史观测，去预测一个我们无法直接控制的过程」的问题。</p>\n<p>这一篇要把在途时长从「承运商报价单上的一个天数」变成<strong>可统计、可分层、可分位数消费的数据资产</strong>，并说清它与承运商报价 SLA 的关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-报价时效与实测时效是两件事\">核心概念：报价时效与实测时效是两件事</h2><p>承运商在合同或报价单上给出的时效（例如「中国到美国西部 3-5 个工作日」）与真实签收数据的分布，几乎从不完全一致，原因有三个：</p>\n<p><strong>报价时效是网络设计值，不是全量实测值</strong>。它通常来自干线时刻表与理想转运路径的推算，假设包裹按最优路径走、不卡在清关、不遇到爆仓。它描述的是「这个网络设计上能做到」，而不是「过去 90 天它实际做到了」。</p>\n<p><strong>报价的统计口径不透明</strong>。「3-5 个工作日」通常隐含一个未声明的达成率——可能是 80%，也可能是 95%。承诺引擎不能消费一个没有达成率的口径，因为承诺的核心决策正是「选哪个分位数」。</p>\n<p><strong>报价忽略了我们的实际情况</strong>。同一承运商、同一线路，从一个高合规度、预清关完备的商家发出的包裹，与从一个低合规度商家发出的包裹，清关耗时差异可以是数天。报价单无法表达这个差异。</p>\n<p>正确的立场是：<strong>报价时效作为基线先验，实测签收分布作为校准后验</strong>。在实测样本不足的新线路上用报价时效（做保守修正），样本充足后切换到实测分布。这个切换必须显式，且可回滚——详见 <a href=\"../promise-ops/transit-time-calibrate\">在途时长模型校准</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;报价时效&lt;br/&gt;carrier quote SLA&quot;] --&gt; C[&quot;基线先验&quot;]&#10;    B[&quot;实测签收数据&lt;br/&gt;POD events&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;校准后验&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E{&quot;样本量&lt;br/&gt;足够?&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt;|不足| F[&quot;用报价 + 保守修正&lt;br/&gt;+1 工作日&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|充足| G[&quot;用实测分布&lt;br/&gt;P50/P90/P95&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; H[&quot;在途时长模型&lt;br/&gt;transit-v*&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H\">graph LR\n    A[\"报价时效&lt;br/&gt;carrier quote SLA\"] --&gt; C[\"基线先验\"]\n    B[\"实测签收数据&lt;br/&gt;POD events\"] --&gt; D[\"校准后验\"]\n    C --&gt; E{\"样本量&lt;br/&gt;足够?\"}\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt;|不足| F[\"用报价 + 保守修正&lt;br/&gt;+1 工作日\"]\n    E --&gt;|充足| G[\"用实测分布&lt;br/&gt;P50/P90/P95\"]\n    F --&gt; H[\"在途时长模型&lt;br/&gt;transit-v*\"]\n    G --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"在途时长的分段结构\">在途时长的分段结构</h2><h3 id=\"四段的边界与数据可得性\">四段的边界与数据可得性</h3><p>跨境在途不是一个整体时长，它至少由四段构成，各段的<strong>可达性与统计方式完全不同</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>段</th>\n<th>起止事件</th>\n<th>数据可得性</th>\n<th>主要变数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>干线出港</td>\n<td>揽收 → 始发国离港</td>\n<td>高（承运商扫描）</td>\n<td>航班/仓位、始发港拥堵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>国际运输</td>\n<td>离港 → 目的国到港</td>\n<td>中（口岸扫描）</td>\n<td>航线、转运、旺季舱位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清关</td>\n<td>到港 → 清关放行</td>\n<td>低（常常无扫描）</td>\n<td>申报质量、查验率、节假日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末端派送</td>\n<td>清关放行 → 签收</td>\n<td>中高（派送扫描 + POD）</td>\n<td>目的国派送网络、地址质量、天气</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分段建模的价值在三个地方。其一，<strong>变数归属清晰</strong>：当整段在途变慢时，分段数据能立刻指出是清关还是末端拖了后腿，而不是笼统地「这条线变慢了」。其二，<strong>日历适用范围精确</strong>：清关段适用目的国海关工作日历，末端段适用承运商派送日历（见 <a href=\"warehouse-carrier-calendar\">仓库/承运商工作日与节假日日历</a>），末端的周末效应尤其明显。其三，<strong>可解释性</strong>：给用户的承诺延迟说明可以精确到「包裹在目的国清关环节」，而不是「因为物流原因」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"清关-最难的一段盲区\">清关：最难的一段盲区</h3><p>清关段是最难的一段，因为它常常<strong>没有扫描事件</strong>——包裹在海关监管区内既不产生承运商扫描，也不产生派送扫描，形成一段观测盲区。工程上的处理方式有两种：其一是用「到港时间」与「放行时间」两个由承运商回传或由海关数据获取的事件，直接求差；其二是当只有到港时间而没有放行时间时，把清关时长合并进末端段一起统计（承认无法分离）。第二种做法会在发现清关问题时失去诊断能力，因此只应作为过渡方案，并应主动补充海关数据源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实测签收数据的清洗\">实测签收数据的清洗</h2><h3 id=\"四类必须剔除的脏数据\">四类必须剔除的脏数据</h3><p>用实测数据建模之前，必须先把几类脏数据剔掉，否则分布会被系统性污染。</p>\n<p><strong>第一条扫描不等于揽收</strong>。承运商可能先「预登记」再实际揽收，两者相隔可达一天。应以<strong>第一次物理揽收</strong>（通常是 <code>picked_up</code> 或 <code>accepted</code> 类型事件）作为在途段起点，而不是「订单创建」或「标签打印」。</p>\n<p><strong>签收时间不等于派送完成</strong>。部分承运商在「派送中」时就会写入一个占位状态，真正的签收要等 POD（Proof of Delivery）回传，后者可能滞后 1-3 天。反过来，也有承运商在投递失败（拒收、无人）后不更新状态，导致订单永远「在途」。这两类必须分开处理：前者影响的是观测延迟，后者影响的是样本完整性。</p>\n<p><strong>数据右删失</strong>（right censoring）。在拉取历史数据建模的那一刻，一些近期订单还在路上。如果简单地把「未签收」的订单排除，那么被排除的恰好是慢的那些（它们还没签收），统计出的时长会<strong>系统性偏快</strong>。这是处理在途数据时最容易犯的统计错误，也是 <a href=\"../promise-ops/transit-time-calibrate\">在途时长模型校准</a> 要专门处理的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>异常值</strong>。跨境包裹偶有长达数月的极端值（错分拣、丢件后找回、地址长期不可达）。分位数统计本身对极端值不敏感，但如果用均值就必须截尾。工程上应保留原始值、在建模时对超过阈值的样本单独归类（<code>anomaly</code> 标记），并分别统计其占比——异常件占比的上升本身就是一个值得监控的信号。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE transit_observation (&#10;  shipment_id       BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  lane_key          VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,&#10;  carrier_code      VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  service_level     VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  handler_key       VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,&#10;  picked_up_at_utc  DATETIME    NOT NULL,&#10;  delivered_at_utc  DATETIME    NULL,&#10;  first_scan_at_utc DATETIME    NULL,&#10;  customs_clear_utc DATETIME    NULL,&#10;  observation_cutoff_utc DATETIME NOT NULL,&#10;  censored          TINYINT(1)  NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  anomaly_flag      TINYINT(1)  NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  transit_work_days DECIMAL(5,2) NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (shipment_id, lane_key),&#10;  KEY idx_lane_cutoff (lane_key, observation_cutoff_utc),&#10;  KEY idx_pickup (picked_up_at_utc)&#10;) ENGINE=InnoDB;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> transit_observation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shipment_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lane_key          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  carrier_code      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  service_level     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  handler_key       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  picked_up_at_utc  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  delivered_at_utc  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  first_scan_at_utc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  customs_clear_utc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  observation_cutoff_utc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  censored          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TINYINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  anomaly_flag      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TINYINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  transit_work_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (shipment_id, lane_key),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_lane_cutoff (lane_key, observation_cutoff_utc),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_pickup (picked_up_at_utc)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) ENGINE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">InnoDB;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个字段值得解释。<code>lane_key</code> 是建模的<strong>聚合键</strong>（线路键），它把「始发仓 → 目的国 → 承运商 → 服务等级」压成一个可索引的字符串，是后续所有分位数统计的粒度。<code>observation_cutoff_utc</code> 记录「这条观测是在什么时刻被采集的」，它让右删失可被识别：<code>delivered_at_utc</code> 为空且 <code>observation_cutoff_utc &gt; picked_up_at_utc + 阈值</code> 的样本是删失样本而非缺失样本。<code>handler_key</code> 记录首程处理方（承运商的目的国合作方），因为同一承运商在目的国的地面伙伴不同，末端表现可以差很多。</p>\n<p><code>transit_work_days</code> 是按目的国派送日历折算出的工作日数，与自然日数分开存储。这个字段让「3 个工作日」与「3 个自然日」不再混淆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分位数在承诺中的消费方式\">分位数在承诺中的消费方式</h2><h3 id=\"违约率与分位数的对应\">违约率与分位数的对应</h3><p>在途时长模型对承诺引擎的输出不是一个数，而是一组分位数加上它们的适用条件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;laneKey&quot;: &quot;CN-SH-01&gt;US-WEST&gt;CARRIER_A&gt;standard&quot;,&#10;  &quot;transitWorkDays&quot;: { &quot;p50&quot;: 5, &quot;p75&quot;: 6, &quot;p90&quot;: 8, &quot;p95&quot;: 10 },&#10;  &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;destination_work_days&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sampleWindowDays&quot;: 90,&#10;  &quot;sampleSize&quot;: 12480,&#10;  &quot;censoredRatio&quot;: 0.031,&#10;  &quot;anomalyRatio&quot;: 0.008,&#10;  &quot;customsDays&quot;: { &quot;p50&quot;: 1, &quot;p90&quot;: 3 },&#10;  &quot;modelVersion&quot;: &quot;transit-v61&quot;,&#10;  &quot;computedAt&quot;: &quot;2026-09-24T02:00:00Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"laneKey\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CN-SH-01>US-WEST>CARRIER_A>standard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"transitWorkDays\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"p50\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"p75\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"p90\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"p95\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"destination_work_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sampleWindowDays\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sampleSize\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12480</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"censoredRatio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.031</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"anomalyRatio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.008</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"customsDays\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"p50\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"p90\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"modelVersion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"transit-v61\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"computedAt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-24T02:00:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>承诺引擎选哪个分位数，是一个<strong>商业决策而非技术决策</strong>，它等价于选择「愿意接受多高的违约率」。设承诺使用分位数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>，那么在模型准确的前提下，违约率近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>transit</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{transit} &gt; t_q) \\approx 1 - q, \\qquad t_q = F^{-1}(q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">transit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是该线路在途时长的累积分布函数。用 P90 承诺，理论违约率约 10%；用 P95，约 5%。这个等式有两个不可忽视的前提：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>稳定的</strong>（不因季节或承运商变更而漂移），且样本<strong>无删失偏差</strong>。任一前提被破坏，实际违约率会偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>，而且通常是偏高——因为模型乐观的偏差会单向累积。第 4 章的两篇分别处理这两个前提的检验与修复。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么分位数不能相加\">为什么分位数不能相加</h3><p>一个重要的工程约束：<strong>分位数不能相加</strong>。如果出库段用 P90、在途段用 P90，把两个 P90 相加得到的不是整链路的 P90，而是比它更保守的值（因为两个分位点上的事件不同时发生）。精确的做法是对整链路做<strong>联合分布的卷积</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>process</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>transit</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{\\text{total}}(t) = \\int F_{\\text{process}}(s) \\cdot f_{\\text{transit}}(t - s)\\, ds</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2222em;vertical-align:-0.8622em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">process</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在实践中，如果两段近似独立，可以用分位数相加加一个经验修正（例如把和的 P90 折为略低于两段 P90 之和），或直接从端到端签收数据学习整链路分位数。后者的代价是失去分段诊断能力，因此推荐的折中是：<strong>分段建模用于诊断与解释，端到端分布用于对外承诺</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"承运商绩效与-sla-对账\">承运商绩效与 SLA 对账</h2><h3 id=\"五个绩效指标\">五个绩效指标</h3><p>在途时长数据同时是承运商管理的输入。对每个 <code>lane_key × carrier_code</code> 组合，应当周期性统计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>P90 在途工作日</td>\n<td>该组合 90 分位在途时长</td>\n<td>承诺参数来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>达标率</td>\n<td>实际 ≤ 报价 SLA 的比例</td>\n<td>SLA 对账索赔依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐段耗时占比</td>\n<td>四段各自占总时长比例</td>\n<td>定位退化环节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常件占比</td>\n<td><code>anomaly_flag = 1</code> 的占比</td>\n<td>服务质量预警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次扫描延迟</td>\n<td>揽收 → 首次扫描的小时数</td>\n<td>反映信息回传质量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「首次扫描延迟」这一项容易被忽略，但它直接决定<strong>履约追踪的用户体验</strong>，并且是承诺与追踪两个系统的共同依赖：如果承运商在揽收后 48 小时才回传第一次扫描，那么追踪页会显示「已发货但无轨迹」两天，用户会误以为包裹没动。它不属于承诺违约，但属于同一批用户的信任损失，本 hub 只把它作为一个承运商数据质量的度量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"达标率的分母陷阱\">达标率的分母陷阱</h3><p>SLA 对账时有一个统计陷阱必须避开：<strong>达标率的分母必须是「已签收」的订单</strong>，且必须按同期签收（cohort）而非按下单日期分组。按下单日期分组会把「近期下单但还在途的订单」计为未达标，人为压低达标率；而混用不同季节下订单的分母又会掩盖在途时长的季节性漂移。正确的口径是：固定一个观察窗口（如某月），只统计该窗口内<strong>签收</strong>的订单，并用它们的下单日期做归一化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>承运商报价时效是<strong>基线先验</strong>，实测签收分布是<strong>校准后验</strong>；样本不足的新线路用报价加保守修正，样本充足后切换到实测分布，切换必须显式且可回滚。</li>\n<li>跨境在途应分段建模：干线出港、国际运输、清关、末端派送。清关段常常是观测盲区，需要专门的数据源补充。</li>\n<li>数据清洗的三条硬规则：第一次物理揽收才是起点；签收需等 POD；区分右删失样本与缺失样本——直接丢弃未签收订单会系统性高估时效。</li>\n<li>承诺消费的是分位数而非均值，选哪一分位等价于选择违约率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>；该等式的成立前提是分布稳定且样本无删失偏差。</li>\n<li>分位数不可直接相加，整链路的准确做法是分布卷积；工程折中是分段建模用于诊断、端到端分布用于承诺。</li>\n<li>承运商绩效需按 <code>lane_key × carrier</code> 统计 P90、达标率、逐段占比、异常占比与首次扫描延迟；SLA 达标率必须以同期签收订单为分母。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>至此本章的三类数据——日历、截单与处理时长、在途时长——都已具备。下一章把它们放进同一个计算：先算还能承诺多少量，再算最早哪天能到。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"在途时长与承运 SLA 数据","id":"在途时长与承运-sla-数据"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：报价时效与实测时效是两件事","id":"核心概念-报价时效与实测时效是两件事"},{"level":2,"text":"在途时长的分段结构","id":"在途时长的分段结构"},{"level":3,"text":"四段的边界与数据可得性","id":"四段的边界与数据可得性"},{"level":3,"text":"清关：最难的一段盲区","id":"清关-最难的一段盲区"},{"level":2,"text":"实测签收数据的清洗","id":"实测签收数据的清洗"},{"level":3,"text":"四类必须剔除的脏数据","id":"四类必须剔除的脏数据"},{"level":2,"text":"分位数在承诺中的消费方式","id":"分位数在承诺中的消费方式"},{"level":3,"text":"违约率与分位数的对应","id":"违约率与分位数的对应"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么分位数不能相加","id":"为什么分位数不能相加"},{"level":2,"text":"承运商绩效与 SLA 对账","id":"承运商绩效与-sla-对账"},{"level":3,"text":"五个绩效指标","id":"五个绩效指标"},{"level":3,"text":"达标率的分母陷阱","id":"达标率的分母陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"截单时间与出库处理时长","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/delivery-promise-engine/promise-data-calendar/cutoff-processing-time"},"next":{"title":"可承诺量（ATP）计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/delivery-promise-engine/atp-ctp-compute/available-to-promise"}}